# Allowlist build context for api/Dockerfile (the only image built from the repo root).
# Everything is excluded unless re-included below, so secrets, local data, virtualenvs
# and the frontend never reach the BuildKit context or an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# README.md and LICENSE are read by the setuptools build (BUILD_INDEXES mode).
!README.md
!LICENSE
!phentrieve/
!api/

# Re-exclude local state inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
api/Dockerfile
api/uv.lock
